---
title:    "CurryBrowser: A Generic Analysis Environment for Curry Programs"
citation: "(WLPE 2006)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/WLPE06.html"
date:     2006-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper presents the ideas of [CurryBrowser](https://www-ps.informatik.uni-kiel.de/currywiki/tools/currybrowser),
a generic analysis environment for Curry programs
that is integrated into the [PAKCS](http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~pakcs/ "Portland Aachen Kiel Curry System") environment.